OK, https://github.com/bundler/bundler/pull/6128 has been merged and I've pulled in the update into Dependabot. I just triggered an update on https://github.com/Floppy/cv and the relevant update PR is https://github.com/Floppy/cv/pull/8. Given all of that, I'm closing this.

@gerrywastaken - this will have been surfaced by the work we did to improve Bundler's resolution logic. There's a blog post on it [here](https://dependabot.com/blog/improving-dependency-resolution-in-bundler) linking to some of the relevant PRs, if you're curious.

Thanks again for the feedback @Floppy!
